  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO will support Uzbekistan in increasing its ratification of the ILO instruments as well as address compliance gaps in national legislation and practices, with a focus on the application of fundamental instruments. Technical advice and assistance will be provided for the ongoing legislative and policy reform to strengthen application of ILS in practice in particular in the cotton and agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
